  "title": "HNI Corporation Increases Quarterly Dividend",
  "summary": "MUSCATINE, Iowa --(BUSINESS WIRE)--May 18, 2026-- HNI Corporation (NYSE: HNI) announced today its Board of Directors declared a quarterly dividend of 35 cents per share on its common stock. The dividend will be payable on June 10, 2026, to shareholders of record at the close of business on May 29,",
